Coded the single available topic (fossil-fuels) for Lena Gonzalez against SB 1137 (2021-2022), which she authored. The bill only bars new drilling permits within 3,200-foot "health protection zones" near sensitive receptors — narrower than any rung's statewide magnitude — so I coded the passage `direction-only` and the row `BLANK`/`direction-only` rather than forcing it onto rung 1 or 2. Written to `labels/coder-3.json`.
